Use one scrollbar geometry for rendering and input.

A long list made a thumb only a few pixels high in the widget model, while
the renderer silently allocated a larger surface to fit its theme end caps.
Clicks on that extra visible area went to the containing window. Apply the
minimum in shared layout and always render the exact requested extent.

